IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`

-- Telecommunications Act 1999 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, informal consolidation (TA1999.txt).
-- PART 5A (continued): s 40 (power to issue directions relating to control of designated telecommunication licensees, designated business trusts
-- and designated trusts).  Seat: the specified person (who acquired the stake, the business or effective control) and the licensee, trustee-manager
-- or trustee the direction reaches.  Fine ceilings are the Act's own; "the specified shares" etc. are those the specified person holds with associates.

§ `s 40(1) and (2): when the Authority may issue a direction, and what it may say`

-- src:3627 | 40.—(1) Without limiting section 31, the Authority may issue a
-- src:3628 | direction under subsection (2) if —
-- src:3630 | (a) a person (called in this section the specified person) —
-- src:3632 | (i) becomes a 12% controller or 30% controller of a
-- src:3633 | designated telecommunication licensee, designated
-- src:3634 | business trust or designated trust;
-- src:3636 | (ii) acquires any business (of a designated
-- src:3637 | telecommunication licensee, designated business
-- src:3638 | trust or designated trust) that is conducted pursuant
-- src:3639 | to a telecommunication licence granted under
-- src:3640 | section 5, or any part of any such business, as a
-- src:3641 | going concern; or
-- src:3643 | (iii) obtains effective control over a designated
-- src:3644 | telecommunication licensee, designated business
-- src:3645 | trust or designated trust; and
-- src:3647 | (b) the Authority is satisfied that —
-- src:3649 | (i) the specified person has thereby contravened
-- src:3650 | section 38(5), (6) or (7);
-- src:3652 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3653 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 74
-- src:3655 | (ii) any condition of approval imposed by the Authority
-- src:3656 | on the specified person when granting its written
-- src:3657 | approval under section 38(5), (6) or (7) has not been
-- src:3658 | complied with;
-- src:3660 | (iii) the specified person has furnished false or
-- src:3661 | misleading information or documents in connection
-- src:3662 | with the person’s application for written approval
-- src:3663 | under section 38(5), (6) or (7);
-- src:3665 | (iv) the Authority would not have granted its written
-- src:3666 | approval under section 38(5), (6) or (7) had it been
-- src:3667 | aware, at the time the approval was granted, of any
-- src:3668 | matter relevant to the specified person’s application
-- src:3669 | for such approval; or
-- src:3671 | (v) the applicable matter referred to in paragraph (a)(i),
-- src:3672 | (ii) or (iii) is likely to substantially lessen
-- src:3673 | competition or is against the public interest.
@ref s 40(1) (src:3627-3673)
GIVEN `a person becomes a 12% controller or 30% controller of a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person acquires, as a going concern, a business (or part) of such a licensee or trust conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person obtains effective control over such a licensee or trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority is satisfied that the specified person has thereby contravened section 38(5), (6) or (7)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority is satisfied that a condition of approval imposed on the specified person when granting its written approval under section 38(5), (6) or (7) has not been complied with` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority is satisfied that the specified person has furnished false or misleading information or documents in connection with the application for written approval` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority is satisfied that it would not have granted its written approval had it been aware, at the time, of a matter relevant to the application` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority is satisfied that the applicable matter is likely to substantially lessen competition or is against the public interest` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(1): the Authority may issue a direction under subsection (2)` MEANS
        (   `a person becomes a 12% controller or 30% controller of a designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust`
         OR `the person acquires, as a going concern, a business (or part) of such a licensee or trust conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5`
         OR `the person obtains effective control over such a licensee or trust`)
    AND (   `the Authority is satisfied that the specified person has thereby contravened section 38(5), (6) or (7)`
         OR `the Authority is satisfied that a condition of approval imposed on the specified person when granting its written approval under section 38(5), (6) or (7) has not been complied with`
         OR `the Authority is satisfied that the specified person has furnished false or misleading information or documents in connection with the application for written approval`
         OR `the Authority is satisfied that it would not have granted its written approval had it been aware, at the time, of a matter relevant to the application`
         OR `the Authority is satisfied that the applicable matter is likely to substantially lessen competition or is against the public interest`)

-- src:3677 | (2) The Authority may, in the circumstances specified in
-- src:3678 | subsection (1), issue such of the following directions as may be
-- src:3679 | applicable:
-- src:3681 | (a) direct the designated telecommunication licensee to do all
-- src:3682 | or any of the following:
-- src:3684 | (i) to restrict the exercise of all or any of the voting
-- src:3685 | rights in respect of the shares which the specified
-- src:3686 | person holds, or which the specified person and the
-- src:3687 | specified person’s associates together hold, in the
-- src:3688 | designated telecommunication licensee (called in
-- src:3689 | this section the specified shares), or to restrict the
-- src:3690 | exercise of the voting power which the specified
-- src:3691 | person controls, or which the specified person and
-- src:3692 | the specified person’s associates together control, in
-- src:3693 | the designated telecommunication licensee, unless
-- src:3694 | the Authority expressly permits such rights or power
-- src:3695 | to be exercised;
-- src:3697 | (ii) to restrict the issuance or offer of shares in the
-- src:3698 | designated telecommunication licensee (whether by
-- src:3700 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3701 | 75 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:3703 | way of rights, bonus or otherwise) in respect of the
-- src:3704 | specified shares, unless the Authority expressly
-- src:3705 | permits such issue or offer;
-- src:3707 | (iii) except in a liquidation of the designated
-- src:3708 | telecommunication licensee, to restrict the payment
-- src:3709 | of any amount (whether by way of dividends or
-- src:3710 | otherwise) in respect of the specified shares, unless
-- src:3711 | the Authority expressly authorises such payment
-- src:3712 | subject to such conditions as the Authority may
-- src:3713 | specify;
-- src:3715 | (b) direct the trustee-manager of the designated business trust
-- src:3716 | to do all or any of the following:
-- src:3718 | (i) to restrict the exercise of all or any of the voting
-- src:3719 | rights in respect of the units which the specified
-- src:3720 | person holds, or which the specified person and the
-- src:3721 | specified person’s associates together hold, in the
-- src:3722 | designated business trust (called in this section the
-- src:3723 | specified units), or to restrict the exercise of the
-- src:3724 | voting power which the specified person controls, or
-- src:3725 | which the specified person and the specified person’s
-- src:3726 | associates together control, in the designated
-- src:3727 | business trust, unless the Authority expressly
-- src:3728 | permits such rights or power to be exercised;
-- src:3730 | (ii) to restrict the issuance or offer of units in the
-- src:3731 | designated business trust (whether by way of rights,
-- src:3732 | bonus or otherwise) in respect of the specified units,
-- src:3733 | unless the Authority expressly permits such issue or
-- src:3734 | offer;
-- src:3736 | (iii) except in a winding up of the designated business
-- src:3737 | trust, to restrict the payment of any amount (whether
-- src:3738 | by way of profits, income or otherwise) in respect of
-- src:3739 | the specified units, unless the Authority expressly
-- src:3740 | authorises such payment subject to such conditions
-- src:3741 | as the Authority may specify;
-- src:3743 | (c) direct the trustee of the designated trust to do all or any of
-- src:3744 | the following:
-- src:3746 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3747 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 76
-- src:3749 | (i) to restrict the exercise of all or any of the voting
-- src:3750 | rights in respect of the equity interests which the
-- src:3751 | specified person holds, or which the specified person
-- src:3752 | and the specified person’s associates together hold,
-- src:3753 | in the designated trust (called in this section the
-- src:3754 | specified equity interests), or to restrict the exercise
-- src:3755 | of the voting power which the specified person
-- src:3756 | controls, or which the specified person and the
-- src:3757 | specified person’s associates together control, in the
-- src:3758 | designated trust, unless the Authority expressly
-- src:3759 | permits such rights or power to be exercised;
-- src:3761 | (ii) to restrict the issuance or offer of equity interests in
-- src:3762 | the designated trust (whether by way of rights, bonus
-- src:3763 | or otherwise) in respect of the specified equity
-- src:3764 | interests, unless the Authority expressly permits such
-- src:3765 | issue or offer;
-- src:3767 | (iii) except in a winding up of the designated trust, to
-- src:3768 | restrict the payment of any amount (whether by way
-- src:3769 | of profits, income or otherwise) in respect of the
-- src:3770 | specified equity interests, unless the Authority
-- src:3771 | expressly authorises such payment subject to such
-- src:3772 | conditions as the Authority may specify;
-- src:3774 | (d) direct the specified person, or any associate of the specified
-- src:3775 | person, to transfer or dispose of all or any part of the
-- src:3776 | specified shares, specified units or specified equity
-- src:3777 | interests (as the case may be) within such time as the
-- src:3778 | Authority may determine and subject to such conditions as
-- src:3779 | the Authority considers appropriate;
-- src:3781 | (e) direct the specified person to transfer or dispose of all or
-- src:3782 | any part of the business or part thereof that is conducted
-- src:3783 | pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under
-- src:3784 | section 5, and that is acquired from the designated
-- src:3785 | telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or
-- src:3786 | designated trust as a going concern, within such time as the
-- src:3787 | Authority may determine and subject to such conditions as
-- src:3788 | the Authority considers appropriate;
-- src:3790 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3791 | 77 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:3793 | (f) direct the specified person to relinquish effective control
-- src:3794 | over the designated telecommunication licensee,
-- src:3795 | designated business trust or designated trust, within such
-- src:3796 | time as the Authority may determine and subject to such
-- src:3797 | conditions as the Authority considers appropriate.
-- src:3799 | [19/2011]
@ref s 40(2) (src:3677-3799)
GIVEN subject IS A STRING
      direction IS A STRING
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(2): the Authority may issue this direction in relation to this designated licensee, trust or person` MEANS
    BRANCH IF subject EQUALS "designated telecommunication licensee"
                 THEN elem direction (LIST "to restrict the exercise of all or any of the voting rights in respect of the specified shares, or of the voting power the specified person (with associates) controls, unless the Authority expressly permits"
                                         , "to restrict the issuance or offer of shares in respect of the specified shares, unless the Authority expressly permits"
                                         , "except in a liquidation, to restrict the payment of any amount in respect of the specified shares, unless the Authority expressly authorises it subject to conditions")
           IF subject EQUALS "trustee-manager of a designated business trust"
                 THEN elem direction (LIST "to restrict the exercise of all or any of the voting rights in respect of the specified units, or of the voting power the specified person (with associates) controls, unless the Authority expressly permits"
                                         , "to restrict the issuance or offer of units in respect of the specified units, unless the Authority expressly permits"
                                         , "except in a winding up, to restrict the payment of any amount in respect of the specified units, unless the Authority expressly authorises it subject to conditions")
           IF subject EQUALS "trustee of a designated trust"
                 THEN elem direction (LIST "to restrict the exercise of all or any of the voting rights in respect of the specified equity interests, or of the voting power the specified person (with associates) controls, unless the Authority expressly permits"
                                         , "to restrict the issuance or offer of equity interests in respect of the specified equity interests, unless the Authority expressly permits"
                                         , "except in a winding up, to restrict the payment of any amount in respect of the specified equity interests, unless the Authority expressly authorises it subject to conditions")
           IF subject EQUALS "specified person or an associate"
                 THEN elem direction (LIST "to transfer or dispose of all or any part of the specified shares, units or equity interests within such time as the Authority determines and subject to such conditions as it considers appropriate")
           OTHERWISE elem direction (LIST "to transfer or dispose of all or any part of the business, or part of it, conducted pursuant to a telecommunication licence granted under section 5 and acquired as a going concern, within such time as the Authority determines and subject to such conditions as it considers appropriate"
                                         , "to relinquish effective control over the designated telecommunication licensee, designated business trust or designated trust, within such time as the Authority determines and subject to such conditions as it considers appropriate")

§ `s 40(3) to (11): notice, compliance, effect, offence`

-- src:3801 | (3) Before issuing a direction to any person under subsection (2),
-- src:3802 | the Authority must, unless the Authority decides that it is not
-- src:3803 | practicable or desirable to do so, cause to be given to that person
-- src:3804 | written notice of the Authority’s intention to issue the direction,
-- src:3805 | specifying a date by which that person may make written
-- src:3806 | representations with regard to the proposed direction.
@ref s 40(3) (src:3801-3806)
GIVEN `the Authority decides that it is not practicable or desirable to give notice` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority caused written notice of its intention to issue the direction to be given to the person, specifying a date by which written representations may be made` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(3): the Authority may issue the direction under subsection (2)` MEANS
    `the Authority decides that it is not practicable or desirable to give notice` OR `the Authority caused written notice of its intention to issue the direction to be given to the person, specifying a date by which written representations may be made`

-- src:3810 | (4) Upon receipt of any written representations mentioned in
-- src:3811 | subsection (3), the Authority must consider them for the purpose of
-- src:3812 | determining whether to issue the direction.
@ref s 40(4) (src:3810-3812)
GIVEN `the Authority received written representations` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority considered them for the purpose of determining whether to issue the direction` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(4): the Authority has acted as the subsection requires` MEANS
    (NOT `the Authority received written representations`) OR `the Authority considered them for the purpose of determining whether to issue the direction`

-- src:3816 | (5) Any person to whom a direction is given under subsection (2)
-- src:3817 | must comply with the direction.
@ref s 40(5) (src:3816-3817)
GIVEN `a direction was given to the person under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(5): the person must comply with the direction` MEANS
    `a direction was given to the person under subsection (2)`

-- src:3821 | (6) The Authority may at any time vary, suspend or revoke any
-- src:3822 | direction issued under this section.
@ref s 40(6) (src:3821-3822)
GIVEN `the Authority varies, suspends or revokes a direction issued under section 40` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(6): the Authority may at any time vary, suspend or revoke the direction` MEANS
    `the Authority varies, suspends or revokes a direction issued under section 40`

-- src:3826 | (7) Any direction given to a person under subsection (2) has effect,
-- src:3827 | despite —
-- src:3829 | (a) the Business Trusts Act 2004, the Companies Act 1967, the
-- src:3830 | Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005, the Trustees Act
-- src:3831 | 1967 and the VCC Act;
-- src:3833 | [S 26/2022 wef 13/01/2022]
-- src:3835 | (b) anything in any listing rules as defined in section 2(1) of
-- src:3836 | the Securities and Futures Act 2001; and
-- src:3838 | (c) the provisions of the memorandum or articles of
-- src:3839 | association, trust deed or other constitution of the
-- src:3840 | designated telecommunication licensee, designated
-- src:3841 | business trust or designated trust.
@ref s 40(7) (src:3826-3841)
GIVEN `a direction was given to a person under subsection (2)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(7): the direction has effect despite the Business Trusts Act 2004, the Companies Act 1967, the Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005, the Trustees Act 1967, the VCC Act, any listing rules, and the memorandum or articles of association, trust deed or other constitution` MEANS
    `a direction was given to a person under subsection (2)`

-- src:3848 | (8) Without affecting subsection (7) —
-- src:3850 | (a) where any direction is issued under subsection (2)(a),
-- src:3851 | unless the direction is suspended or revoked —
-- src:3853 | (i) the voting rights in respect of the specified shares,
-- src:3854 | and the voting power which the specified person
-- src:3855 | controls, or which the specified person and the
-- src:3856 | specified person’s associates together control, in the
-- src:3857 | designated telecommunication licensee, are not
-- src:3858 | exercisable unless the Authority expressly permits
-- src:3859 | such rights or power to be exercised;
-- src:3861 | (ii) no shares in the designated telecommunication
-- src:3862 | licensee are to be issued or offered (whether by
-- src:3863 | way of rights, bonus or otherwise) in respect of the
-- src:3864 | specified shares, unless the Authority expressly
-- src:3865 | permits such issue or offer; and
-- src:3867 | (iii) except in a liquidation of the designated
-- src:3868 | telecommunication licensee, no amount is to be
-- src:3869 | paid (whether by way of dividends or otherwise) in
-- src:3870 | respect of the specified shares, unless the Authority
-- src:3871 | expressly authorises such payment;
-- src:3873 | (b) where any direction is issued under subsection (2)(b),
-- src:3874 | unless the direction is suspended or revoked —
-- src:3876 | (i) the voting rights in respect of the specified units, and
-- src:3877 | the voting power which the specified person
-- src:3878 | controls, or which the specified person and the
-- src:3879 | specified person’s associates together control, in the
-- src:3880 | designated business trust, are not exercisable unless
-- src:3881 | the Authority expressly permits such rights or power
-- src:3882 | to be exercised;
-- src:3884 | (ii) no units in the designated business trust are to be
-- src:3885 | issued or offered (whether by way of rights, bonus or
-- src:3886 | otherwise) in respect of the specified units, unless the
-- src:3887 | Authority expressly permits such issue or offer; and
-- src:3889 | (iii) except in a winding up of the designated business
-- src:3890 | trust, no amount is to be paid (whether by way of
-- src:3892 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3893 | 79 Telecommunications Act 1999 2020 Ed.
-- src:3895 | profits, income or otherwise) in respect of the
-- src:3896 | specified units, unless the Authority expressly
-- src:3897 | authorises such payment; or
-- src:3899 | (c) where any direction is issued under subsection (2)(c),
-- src:3900 | unless the direction is suspended or revoked —
-- src:3902 | (i) the voting rights in respect of the specified equity
-- src:3903 | interests, and the voting power which the specified
-- src:3904 | person controls, or which the specified person and
-- src:3905 | the specified person’s associates together control, in
-- src:3906 | the designated trust, are not exercisable unless the
-- src:3907 | Authority expressly permits such rights or power to
-- src:3908 | be exercised;
-- src:3910 | (ii) no equity interests in the designated trust are to be
-- src:3911 | issued or offered (whether by way of rights, bonus or
-- src:3912 | otherwise) in respect of the specified equity interests,
-- src:3913 | unless the Authority expressly permits such issue or
-- src:3914 | offer; and
-- src:3916 | (iii) except in a winding up of the designated trust, no
-- src:3917 | amount is to be paid (whether by way of profits,
-- src:3918 | income or otherwise) in respect of the specified
-- src:3919 | equity interests, unless the Authority expressly
-- src:3920 | authorises such payment.
@ref s 40(8) (src:3848-3920)
GIVEN `a direction was issued under subsection (2)(a), (b) or (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the direction is suspended or revoked` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority expressly permits the exercise of the voting rights or power` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(8)(a)(i), (b)(i) and (c)(i): the voting rights in respect of the specified shares, units or equity interests, and the voting power the specified person controls, are exercisable` MEANS
    (NOT `a direction was issued under subsection (2)(a), (b) or (c)`) OR `the direction is suspended or revoked` OR `the Authority expressly permits the exercise of the voting rights or power`

GIVEN `a direction was issued under subsection (2)(a), (b) or (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the direction is suspended or revoked` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority expressly permits the issue or offer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(8)(a)(ii), (b)(ii) and (c)(ii): shares, units or equity interests may be issued or offered in respect of the specified ones` MEANS
    (NOT `a direction was issued under subsection (2)(a), (b) or (c)`) OR `the direction is suspended or revoked` OR `the Authority expressly permits the issue or offer`

GIVEN `a direction was issued under subsection (2)(a), (b) or (c)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the direction is suspended or revoked` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the payment is made in a liquidation of the designated telecommunication licensee, or a winding up of the designated business trust or designated trust` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority expressly authorises the payment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(8)(a)(iii), (b)(iii) and (c)(iii): an amount may be paid in respect of the specified shares, units or equity interests` MEANS
    (NOT `a direction was issued under subsection (2)(a), (b) or (c)`) OR `the direction is suspended or revoked` OR `the payment is made in a liquidation of the designated telecommunication licensee, or a winding up of the designated business trust or designated trust` OR `the Authority expressly authorises the payment`

-- src:3924 | (9) Subject to subsection (10), any person who contravenes
-- src:3925 | subsection (5) shall be guilty of an offence and shall be liable on
-- src:3926 | conviction —
-- src:3928 | (a) in the case of an individual, to a fine not exceeding
-- src:3929 | $125,000 or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding
-- src:3930 | 3 years or to both and, in the case of a continuing offence,
-- src:3931 | to a further fine not exceeding $12,500 for every day or
-- src:3932 | part of a day during which the offence continues after
-- src:3933 | conviction; or
-- src:3935 | (b) in any other case, to a fine not exceeding $250,000 and, in
-- src:3936 | the case of a continuing offence, to a further fine not
-- src:3938 | Informal Consolidation – version in force from 2/10/2026
-- src:3939 | 2020 Ed. Telecommunications Act 1999 80
-- src:3941 | exceeding $25,000 for every day or part of a day during
-- src:3942 | which the offence continues after conviction.
@ref s 40(9) (src:3924-3942)
GIVEN `the person contravenes subsection (5)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is an individual` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a telecommunication licensee that is a designated telecommunication licensee mentioned in subsection (2)(a), a trustee-manager mentioned in subsection (2)(b), or a trustee mentioned in subsection (2)(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `Penalty`
`s 40(9) and (10): the person is guilty of an offence and the most the penalty may be (the further daily fine is $12,500 for an individual, $25,000 otherwise)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF (NOT `the person contravenes subsection (5)`) OR `the person is a telecommunication licensee that is a designated telecommunication licensee mentioned in subsection (2)(a), a trustee-manager mentioned in subsection (2)(b), or a trustee mentioned in subsection (2)(c)` THEN NOTHING
           IF `the person is an individual` THEN JUST (`Penalty` OF 125000, 36, 12500, FALSE)
           OTHERWISE JUST (`Penalty` OF 250000, 0, 25000, FALSE)

-- src:3946 | (10) Subsection (9) does not apply to a telecommunication licensee
-- src:3947 | that is —
-- src:3949 | (a) a designated telecommunication licensee mentioned in
-- src:3950 | subsection (2)(a);
-- src:3952 | (b) a trustee‑manager of the designated business trust
-- src:3953 | mentioned in subsection (2)(b); or
-- src:3955 | (c) a trustee of the designated trust mentioned in
-- src:3956 | subsection (2)(c).
-- src:3957 | [32D
@ref s 40(10) (src:3946-3957)
GIVEN `the person is a designated telecommunication licensee mentioned in subsection (2)(a)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a trustee-manager of the designated business trust mentioned in subsection (2)(b)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person is a trustee of the designated trust mentioned in subsection (2)(c)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(10): subsection (9) applies to the telecommunication licensee` MEANS
    NOT (`the person is a designated telecommunication licensee mentioned in subsection (2)(a)` OR `the person is a trustee-manager of the designated business trust mentioned in subsection (2)(b)` OR `the person is a trustee of the designated trust mentioned in subsection (2)(c)`)

-- src:3961 | (11) A reference in this section to the issuing of a direction includes
-- src:3962 | a varying of that direction.
@ref s 40(11) (src:3961-3962)
GIVEN `the direction is varied` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 40(11): the reference to the issuing of a direction includes the varying` MEANS
    `the direction is varied`
